 "comment": "clause44: a voucher's PARTYGSTIN that is blank once stripped (spaces, a tab, a no-break space) falls back to the party ledger's GSTIN: a registered creditor with no tax line is 'exempt or non-GST' and with a tax line 'other than composition', a composition creditor is composition, a creditor with no GSTIN stays unregistered, a party named on no ledger master is unregistered; a populated PARTYGSTIN is still read as before, and a zero-width space is not blank. Every GSTIN is invented (fourteenth character Y).",
